  "title": "Shaped Vanilla Cookies",
  "description": "These are soft, cake-like cookies, best with frosting. Roll them out thickly, and bake no more than 8 minutes. They will stay soft, and everyone raves over them. I use them as cutouts for holidays.",
  "authors": [
